# Notices (priority 1): a city bond repaid at maturity is chirped by City Treasury. Sells a ₡1,000
# 1-year bond and backdates it a year so it matures on the next day (about ₡30 of interest).
name notices: a city bond repaid at maturity is chirped by City Treasury
issue-bond 1 1000
notices on
bond-backdate 360
run-days 1
wait 1
expect-log notices: chirped [City Treasury] Bond #
expect-log repaid at maturity: ₡1,000 plus the last ₡
capture bond-notice
cleanup:
notices off
redeem-new-bonds
